        <div class="px-6 py-5 prose-dark">
          <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">You can control and manage cookies in several ways:</p>
          <ul class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2 space-y-1.5">
            <li><strong>Browser Settings:</strong> Most browsers allow you to view, manage, and delete cookies through their settings. You can configure your browser to block all cookies, block third-party cookies, or alert you when a cookie is being set.</li>
            <li><strong>Opt-Out Tools:</strong> Many analytics providers offer opt-out mechanisms. For example, you can opt out of Google Analytics by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics Opt-Out Browser Add-on</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Do Not Track:</strong> Car Alpha respects "Do Not Track" (DNT) signals sent by your browser where technically feasible.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-3"><strong>Please note:</strong> Disabling certain cookies may affect the functionality of Car Alpha. Essential cookies cannot be disabled as they are required for the site to operate.</p>
